  "description": "Our Blacktop 1.0 pairs the latest eBike technology to a tough city commuter at an affordable price point, with a fully integrated downtube battery and powerful rear drive motor. Add an optional city pack for mudguards and rear rack.\n\nOur all-new entry-level, affordable city commuter packs in some of the very latest eBike technologies such as a fully integrated and detachable Samsung 10.4AH battery to provide an extended range up to 60KM. The handlebar mounted LCD information display shows usual information such as battery level, speed, trip distance and more. It also allows you to choose your assistance level, with 5 levels to choose from. With Shimano 7-speed gearing, confidence-inspiring city/ comfort geometry and Tektro disc brakes, the affordable Blacktop 1.0 eBike is a great value eCommuter to cruise around the city effortlessly.\nAvailable with an optional City Pack which includes mudguards and a rear pannier rack (as pictured below).",
